eco fix for Elm OS, on top of 0003 (commits 245c49b and 73b4e2a on branch claude/project-thread-lyd4mb
of MartinSStewart/eco-compiler): a let inside a fused Bytes item encoder, which 0002 made fusable,
was resolved by name from any function in the program ("MONO_001 record expression whose type is
not an MRecord"), or not at all for `let (Tri t) = f x` ("lookupVar: unbound variable _v0").

